# Project A System Architecture & Packet Flow
* Client [Unity Client] -> Server [C++ IOCP Server] : NetworkManager (TCP/IP)
* Server -> DB [Database] : Entity Framework / Stored Procedure
* ProtoFiles [Protobuf Definition] -> CodeGen [Packet Generator] : Input (.proto)
* CodeGen -> Server : Generate PacketHandler.h
* CodeGen -> Client : Generate PacketManager_Gen.cs
